# Amatly.com — Netlify / Cloudflare Pages üçin HTTP sözbaşylary (Apache hostinginde .htaccess ulanylýar).
# Gysyş bu hostinglerde awtomatik. Keş: HTML, CSS, JS — hostingiň adaty düzgüni (her gezek barlanýar);
# harplar 1 ýyl, suratlar 30 gün. Bir faýla birnäçe düzgün gabat gelse, Cache-Control birleşdirilýär — şonuň üçin «/*» içinde ýok.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/assets/og/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/assets/*/images/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/icons/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000

/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /

/api/*
  X-Accel-Buffering: no
